+# OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.
+
+
+"""Simple WebSocket client named echo_client just because of historical reason.
+
+mod_pywebsocket directory must be in PYTHONPATH.
+
+Example Usage:
+
+# server setup
+ % cd $pywebsocket
